WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Last night, President Donald Trump delivered a primetime address, so let's talk about what he said and why it's important to pay attention to.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Much of the address was centered around the continued conspiracy that the 2020 election was rigged and an urge for Congress to pass the Save America Act.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
This is extremely important to keep an eye on. The 2020 election is not being brought up as a pointless beating of a dead horse.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
This is a political strategy and it's being used to attempt to shift the scale in upcoming elections.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
First and foremost, claims that the 2020 election was stolen or rigged are straight-up lies, and last night's address was continued spread of misinformation.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.680
Countless investigations, audits, recounts, and over 50 court proceedings invested the

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.740
2020 election, and all of them came back with the same consensus, that the 2020 election

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.740
was legit.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:39.280
And Trump and his buddies know this, but they also know that by continuing to push this

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:43.060
rigged election story into the heads of the American people, they are weakening the systems

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:46.560
that uphold democracy and putting that power right back into their hands.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.960
Election denialism is a strategy that has been used throughout history by leaders as

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.920
an attempt to abuse power, and this is threatening to democracy.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:56.800
Additionally, last night Donald Trump's push for Congress to pass the Save America Act,

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.320
which is a voter suppression bill, shows that if this administration has the chance to do

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:03.500
anything to make voting less inclusive, they will take it.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.160
So pay attention, stay aware, and if you can do anything to get involved or make your voice

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:08.160
heard, do it.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.160
That's all she wrote.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:09.660
Bye guys!
